# Applies to any `docker build` run from the repository root (see
# docker/backend.Dockerfile's context note). Keeps the build context small —
# without this, frontend/node_modules alone would add hundreds of MB to
# every backend image build for files the backend image never uses.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.next
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log
frontend/
docs/
.DS_Store
